        <mxCell id="7qZIqy6ZL3z2aXDZ3tAA-33" value="У болезни Паркинсона огромная сложность.&lt;div&gt;Parkinson&#39;s disease has a tremendous complexity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Calibri;fontSize=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="720" y="320" width="560" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7qZIqy6ZL3z2aXDZ3tAA-34" value="Болезнь Паркинсона &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b266ff&quot;&gt;усиливается&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; нелинейным прогрессированием патогенеза.&lt;div&gt;Parkinson&#39;s disease is increased&amp;nbsp;by the nonlinear progression of pathogenesis.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Calibri;fontSize=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="720" y="360" width="560" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7qZIqy6ZL3z2aXDZ3tAA-35" value="Патогенез болезни Паркинсона &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b266ff&quot;&gt;происходит&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; между молекулярными системами.&lt;div&gt;The pathogenesis of Parkinson&#39;s disease occurs between molecular systems.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Calibri;fontSize=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="720" y="400" width="560" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7qZIqy6ZL3z2aXDZ3tAA-36" value="Патогенез болезни Паркинсона &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b266ff&quot;&gt;происходит&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; между клеточными системами.&lt;div&gt;The pathogenesis of Parkinson&#39;s disease occurs between cellular systems.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Calibri;fontSize=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="720" y="440" width="560" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7qZIqy6ZL3z2aXDZ3tAA-37" value="Патогенез болезни Паркинсона &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b266ff&quot;&gt;происходит&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; между органическими системами.&lt;div&gt;The pathogenesis of Parkinson&#39;s disease occurs between organic systems.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Calibri;fontSize=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="720" y="480" width="560" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
